OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Navy warships track Russian
OL,4,Avessels for three days in UK waters
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Navy warships and a helicopter
OL,7,Fspent three days tracking Russian Navy
OL,8,Fvessels and sanctioned cargo ships in
OL,9,Fan "intense" operation in the North Sea
OL,10,Fand English Channel.
OL,12,FHMS Duncan, HMS St Albans and HMS
OL,13,FSevern used radars to monitor four
OL,14,Fvessels last week, while a Merlin
OL,15,Fhelicopter provided surveillance from
OL,16,Fthe sky.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
