OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Navy warships track Russian
OL,4,Avessels for three days in UK waters
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Since that successful operation, we
OL,7,Fhave seen Russian shadow fleet vessels
OL,8,Fincreasingly forced to change their
OL,9,Froutes, imposing significant cost and
OL,10,Fdelays to their journeys," Gen Sir Gwyn
OL,11,FJenkins, the First Sea Lord and Chief
OL,12,Fof Naval Staff, said.
OL,14,FIt comes as data shows Royal Navy
OL,15,Factivity to monitor Russian movements
OL,16,Fis up 25% so far this year compared to
OL,17,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
